{{roff .Summary}}{{if .Passthrough}} (passed through as typed){{end}}{{with .Default}} (default {{roff .}}){{end}}{{with .Constraints}} ({{roff .}}){{end}}{{with .Accepts}} ({{roff .}}){{end}}{{with listed .Enum .EnumValues}} [{{roff (join . "|")}}]{{end}}{{with .Stability}} ({{.}}){{end}}{{if .Deprecated}} ({{roff (deprecation .Deprecated .DeprecatedSince .RemovedIn)}}){{end}}
{{template "description" .}}{{template "rules" .}}{{if or .Env .ConfigKey}}.br
{{alsoSetBy .Env .ConfigKey "\\fB" "\\fR"}}
{{end}}{{template "values" .}}{{end}}{{end}}
{{range .FlagGroups}}.SH {{roffArg (upper (default "Options" .Title))}}
